logging will happen like this so we can check uptill where it works and where it breaks so we can easily debug and find the root cause

{"event": "START create_complaint", "user_id": "...", "data": {...}}
{"event": "CHECK_DUPLICATES", "lat": ..., "lng": ..., "category": "..."}
{"event": "DUPLICATE_RESULT", "is_duplicate": false, "duplicate_count": 0}
{"event": "ROUTE_COMPLAINT", "category": "..."}
{"event": "ROUTE_RESULT", "department_id": "...", "department_name": "..."}
{"event": "PREPARE_RECORD", "address_text": "...", "priority_score": 1}
{"event": "RECORD_READY", "complaint_record": {...}}
{"event": "COMPLAINT_INSERTED", "complaint_id": "..."}
{"event": "UPLOAD_MEDIA_START", "file_path": "...", "filename": "..."}
{"event": "UPLOAD_MEDIA_SUCCESS", "file_url": "..."}
{"event": "MEDIA_RECORD_INSERTED", "complaint_id": "...", "file_url": "..."}
{"event": "COMPLAINT_CREATED_SUCCESS", "complaint_id": "...", "user_id": "..."}


**NEED TO MAKE IT LOG INTO THE "..sih-civic-app\backend\events.log" INSTEAD OF JUST THE TERMINAL**

